   "hook": "When judging real usefulness, what evidence would convince you most?",
   "text": "Our next question is, when judging real usefulness, what evidence would convince you most? I think I've spoken to this in a cool way, but one thing I will say is that if you really think about what would prove that something is useful, my best answer would be customers. So usage, customers, and it's absolutely possible to build something rapidly. AI is a gift for this time, and so it's possible to build something rapidly, get it out to customers, and actually iterate on it multiple times for joining the build window.",
